OL,3,GNEWSAPool to shut for six months for
OL,4,Aroof repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pool at a leisure centre in Sheffield
OL,7,Fis to close for six months so roof
OL,8,Fsafety repairs can be carried out after
OL,9,Fongoing disruption was caused to
OL,10,Fswimming sessions.
OL,12,FThe pool at Thorncliffe Leisure Centre
OL,13,Fin High Green will be shut from 16
OL,14,FNovember until May next year to enable
OL,15,Fremedial work to take place on the
OL,16,Froof.
OL,18,FA council meeting on Monday was told
OL,19,Fthat interim repairs had not solved the
OL,20,Fproblem, so a "comprehensive programme
OL,21,Fof remedial works" had been agreed.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
