OL,3,GNEWSAPool to shut for six months for
OL,4,Aroof repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Brian Holmshaw, chair of the
OL,7,Fcity council communities, parks and
OL,8,Fleisure policy committee, said
OL,9,Fcustomers would be told about
OL,10,Fmembership arrangements and access to
OL,11,Falternative facilities before the
OL,12,Fclosure.
